or Mickey Christ I
don't even know anymore.

00:26:36.600 --> 00:26:40.140
So maybe we're just all Disney adults now,

00:26:40.140 --> 00:26:41.763
whether we realize it or not.

00:26:42.630 --> 00:26:43.830
But what do you think?

00:26:43.830 --> 00:26:46.515
